&lt;li&gt;Based in New York, New Jersey, Washington State, or California (outside of the San Francisco Bay area): $241,200.00 (Developing Minimum for Tier 2) - $301,500.00 (Mid for Tier 2).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Based in the San Francisco Bay area, California: $268,000.00 (Developing Minimum for Tier 1) - $335,000.00 (Mid for Tier 1).&lt;/li&gt;
