&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide architecture and technical direction for Ubuntu desktop applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure strong integration with the Ubuntu platform, Snap ecosystem, and system services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in design reviews and key technical decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Promote high standards for performance, reliability, and security&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support a team of talented engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mentor and grow engineers across frontend and systems domains&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Foster a culture of ownership, collaboration, and continuous improvement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delivery and Engineering Excellence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
