&lt;li&gt;Experience working with modern Linux desktop technologies such as &lt;strong&gt;Wayland, D-Bus, Systemd, or GNOME&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal communication skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work effectively in a globally distributed engineering team&lt;/li&gt;
